      "side": 1,
      "message": "So the interesting change to DT with DT_STRING_UPPER_TOKEN the binding doesn\u0027t have to be an enum, any string works. I think this is fine for the binding and we can have an overlay DTS file per AP. The overlay can amend the nodes with:\n\n\u0026ap_in_sleep_l {\n  power-signal-enum-name \u003d \"AP_IN_S3_L\";\n};\n\nSo just like we have a default dts file per EC chip, we could do the same thing with overlaying the AP information.",
